Package: sg-office-editors
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fontconfig
Recommends: fonts-crosextra-carlito, fonts-crosextra-caladea, fonts-liberation2
Description: SG Office editors: documents, spreadsheets and presentations (based on ONLYOFFICE)
 SG Office is Stained Glass OS's office suite: Documents, Spreadsheets and
 Presentations, each document in a window of its own. It reads and writes
 Microsoft Office's formats (.docx, .xlsx, .pptx and their 97-2003
 predecessors) and OpenDocument.
 .
 Its engines are ONLYOFFICE's (sdkjs, core and web-apps, by Ascensio System
 SIA, AGPL-3.0), built from source with Stained Glass OS's changes, and run
 in Qt WebEngine. The program is /usr/bin/sg-office; the shell's SG Office
 Documents, Spreadsheets and Presentations (package sg-office) start it.
